---
/**
 * Medical disclaimer — visible box placed ABOVE each calculator tool.
 * Required by PRD §15 (non-negotiable). Hardcoded English (EN-only pages).
 */
---

<div
  class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/70 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 dark:border-amber-800/60 px-4 py-3.5 sm:px-5 flex gap-3 items-start"
  role="note"
  aria-label="Medical disclaimer"
>
  <svg
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"></path>
    <path d="M12 9v4"></path>
    <path d="M12 17h.01"></path>
  </svg>
  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">
    <strong class="font-bold">Please note:</strong> these are educational estimates based on
    published growth references, not medical advice. If you have concerns about a child's
    growth, consult a pediatrician.
  </p>
</div>
